    title: 'SEO Reporting for UK Businesses: What a Good Monthly Report Should Show',
    description: 'Good SEO reporting links rankings and traffic to enquiries and sales. Learn which metrics to track, how to set up reports and what to ask your agency.',
    date: '2026-10-30',
